{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43260","headline":"风光草际浮 · 张复元","name":"风光草际浮","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"纤纤春草长，迟日度风光。\n靃靡含新彩，霏微笼远芳。\n殊姿媚原野，佳色满池塘。\n最好垂清露，偏宜带艳阳。\n浅深浮嫩绿，轻丽拂余香。\n好助莺迁势，乘时冀便翔。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张复元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}